{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":2,"title":"Spiritual knowledge","narrator":{"name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"},"duration":495.624,"scenes":[{"layout":"title","headline":"Spiritual Knowledge","visual":["The Gita in miniature"],"L":[],"say":"Chapter Two. Spiritual Knowledge. Many readers call it the Gita in miniature, because almost every great idea of the book appears here for the first time.","start":0.0,"at":0.576,"end":11.088,"words":[[0.05,0.388,"Chapter"],[0.45,0.362,"Two"],[1.175,0.562,"Spiritual"],[1.75,0.625,"Knowledge"],[2.788,0.287,"Many"],[3.087,0.388,"readers"],[3.487,0.263,"call"],[3.763,0.1,"it"],[3.875,0.087,"the"],[3.975,0.35,"Gita"],[4.338,0.163,"in"],[4.513,0.6,"miniature"],[5.362,0.325,"because"],[5.7,0.375,"almost"],[6.1,0.287,"every"],[6.4,0.287,"great"],[6.7,0.425,"idea"],[7.138,0.1,"of"],[7.25,0.1,"the"],[7.362,0.263,"book"],[7.638,0.4,"appears"],[8.05,0.312,"here"],[8.375,0.125,"for"],[8.512,0.087,"the"],[8.613,0.3,"first"],[8.925,0.362,"time"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"A warrior in tears","visual":["Arjuna sits in his chariot, his bow on the floor","Sanjaya reports every word to the blind king","Krishna, as if smiling, begins to speak"],"L":[],"say":"We left Arjuna sitting in his chariot between two armies, his bow on the floor, his eyes full of tears. Sanjaya, reporting to the blind king, tells us that Krishna looked at his friend and, as if smiling, began to speak. Here the book marks a line: the teachings of the Gita begin.","start":11.088,"at":11.664,"end":32.064,"words":[[0.1,0.113,"We"],[0.225,0.3,"left"],[0.537,0.5,"Arjuna"],[1.05,0.362,"sitting"],[1.425,0.075,"in"],[1.512,0.138,"his"],[1.663,0.512,"chariot"],[2.188,0.325,"between"],[2.525,0.225,"two"],[2.763,0.537,"armies"],[3.325,0.662,"his"],[4.0,0.338,"bow"],[4.35,0.113,"on"],[4.475,0.075,"the"],[4.562,0.5,"floor"],[5.075,0.588,"his"],[5.675,0.375,"eyes"],[6.062,0.2,"full"],[6.275,0.113,"of"],[6.4,0.55,"tears"],[7.35,0.725,"Sanjaya"],[8.088,0.487,"reporting"],[8