.738,0.138,"is"],[17.887,0.525,"lost"],[18.825,0.062,"The"],[18.9,0.438,"restless"],[19.35,0.475,"senses"],[19.837,0.163,"can"],[20.012,0.312,"carry"],[20.337,0.4,"away"],[20.75,0.25,"even"],[21.012,0.075,"a"],[21.1,0.362,"wise"],[21.475,0.475,"mind"],[22.475,0.175,"like"],[22.663,0.037,"a"],[22.712,0.525,"storm"],[23.25,0.412,"carrying"],[23.675,0.1,"a"],[23.788,0.3,"boat"],[24.113,0.312,"away"],[24.438,0.175,"from"],[24.625,0.05,"the"],[24.688,0.475,"shore"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L10"],"ref":"2.70","verse":"One attains peace when all desires dissipate within the mind without creating any mental disturbance, just as river waters enter the full ocean without creating any disturbance. One who desires material objects is never peaceful.","key":true,"vs":[9,44],"say":"And the chapter's final picture is peace. Verse seventy. One attains peace when all desires dissipate within the mind without creating any mental disturbance, just as river waters enter the full ocean without creating any disturbance. One who desires material objects is never peaceful.","start":229.512,"at":230.088,"end":249.984,"words":[[0.087,0.1,"And"],[0.2,0.075,"the"],[0.287,0.55,"chapter's"],[0.85,0.338,"final"],[1.2,0.475,"picture"],[1.688,0.2,"is"],[1.9,0.512,"peace"],[2.812,0.263,"Verse"],[3.087,0.588,"seventy"],[4.075,0.2,"One"],[4.287,0.425,"attains"],[4.725,0.412,"peace"],[5.15,0.175,"when"],[5.338,0.2,"all"],[5.55,0.5,"desires"],[6.062,0.5,"dissipate"],[6.575,0.263,"within"],[6.85,0.062,"the"],[6.925,0.412,"mind"],[7.35,0.312,"without"],[7.675,0.487,"creating"],[8.175,0.225,"any"],[8.412,0.325,"mental"],[8.75,0.7,"disturbance"],[9.988,0.3,"just"],[10.3,0.15,"as"],[10.463,0.287,"river"],[10.762,0.512,"waters"],[11.287,0.263,"enter"],[11.562,0.087,"the"],[11.662,0.325,"full"],[12.0,0.4,"ocean"],[12.412,0.3,"without"],[12.725,0.487,"creating"],[13.225,0.212,"any"],[13.45,0.75,"disturbance"],[14.613,0.338,"One"],[14.963,0.225,"who"],[15.2,0.662,"desires"],[15.875,0.55,"material"],[16.438,0.55,"objects"],[17.0,0.15,"is"],[17.163,0.325,"never"],[17.5,0.575,"peaceful"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"The Soul Is Eternal—Nothing Can Destroy It","visual":["The soul never dies and never changes","Nothing physical can harm it","Fear of death and loss loses its grip"],"L":["L1"],"say":"Lesson one. The soul is eternal, and nothing can destroy it. Everything else in this chapter rests on this. When you know that who you really are cannot be harmed, the fears of death, loss and destruction take their proper, smaller place.","start":249.984,"at":250.56,"end":266.664,"words":[[0.062,0.35,"Lesson"],[0.425,0.375,"one"],[1.188,0.062,"The"],[1.262,0.412,"soul"],[1.688,0.138,"is"],[1.837,0.613,"eternal"],[2.837,0.2,"and"],[3.05,0.412,"nothing"],[3.475,0.175,"can"],[3.663,0.463,"destroy"],[4.138,0.275,"it"],[4.787,0.425,"Everything"],[5.225,0.362,"else"],[5.6,0.15,"in"],[5.763,0.163,"this"],[5.938,0.463,"chapter"],[6.412,0.375,"rests"],[6.8,0.188,"on"],[7.0,0.375,"this"],[7.787,0.113,"When"],[7.912,0.1,"you"],[8.025,0.263,"know"],[8.3,0.138,"that"],[8.45,0.188,"who"],[8.65,0.188,"you"],[8.85,0.35,"really"],[9.213,0.163,"are"],[9.387,0.338,"cannot"],[9.738,0.113,"be"],[9.863,0.575,"harmed"],[10.875,0.138,"the"],[11.025,0.4,"fears"],[11.438,0.125,"of"],[11.575,0.412,"death"],[12.0,0.412,"loss"],[12.425,0.087,"and"],[12.525,0.6,"destruction"],[13.137,0.212,"take"],[13.363,0.138,"their"],[13.512,0.45,"proper"],[13.975,0.438,"smaller"],[14.425,0.45,"place"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Focus on Effort and Action, Not Results","visual":["You control your effort, not the outcome","Do your best, then accept what comes","Obsessing over results creates anxiety"],"L":["L2"],"say":"Lesson two. Focus on effort and action, not results. You can choose how hard you work, how honestly, and with what intention. You cannot choose what happens next. Peace comes from giving your best and then letting the outcome be what it will be.","start":266.664,"at":267.24,"end":283.68,"words":[[0.062,0.338,"Lesson"],[0.412,0.375,"two"],[1.188,0.4,"Focus"],[1.6,0.188,"on"],[1.8,0.4,"effort"],[2.212,0.113,"and"],[2.337,0.525,"action"],[2.875,0.35,"not"],[3.237,0.6,"results"],[4.225,0.087,"You"],[4.325,0.15,"can"],[4.487,0.35,"choose"],[4.85,0.2,"how"],[5.062,0.275,"hard"],[5.35,0.125,"you"],[5.487,0.362,"work"],[5.862,0.275,"how"],[6.15,0.688,"honestly"],[7.1,0.225,"and"],[7.338,0.163,"with"],[7.513,0.188,"what"],[7.713,0.65,"intention"],[8.738,0.075,"You"],[8.825,0.362,"cannot"],[9.2,0.4,"choose"],[9.613,0.15,"what"],[9.775,0.438,"happens"],[10.225,0.525,"next"],[11.15,0.263,"Peace"],[11.425,0.35,"comes"],[11.787,0.212,"from"],[12.012,0.263,"giving"],[12.287,0.15,"your"],[12.45,0.45,"best"],[12.925,0.138,"and"],[13.075,0.237,"then"],[13.325,0.3,"letting"],[13.637,0.075,"the"],[13.725,0.463,"outcome"],[14.2,0.212,"be"],[14.425,0.15,"what"],[14.588,0.1,"it"],[14.7,0.163,"will"],[14.875,0.325,"be"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Your Duty (Dharma) Is More Important Than Your Comfort","visual":["Everyone has a role and responsibilities","Integrity matters more than comfort","Duty sometimes asks for sacrifice"],"L":["L3"],"say":"Lesson three. Your duty, your dharma, matters more than your comfort. Every person has a role. Doing it with integrity is more important than avoiding what is hard or doing what feels good in the moment. Sometimes duty asks you to sacrifice, and that is part of its dignity.","start":283.68,"at":284.256,"end":302.976,"words":[[0.062,0.362,"Lesson"],[0.438,0.45,"three"],[1.288,0.113,"Your"],[1.413,0.425,"duty"],[1.85,0.125,"your"],[1.988,0.438,"dharma"],[3.1,0.412,"matters"],[3.525,0.287,"more"],[3.825,0.125,"than"],[3.962,0.138,"your"],[4.112,0.5,"comfort"],[4.987,0.275,"Every"],[5.275,0.425,"person"],[5.713,0.237,"has"],[5.963,0.05,"a"],[6.025,0.512,"role"],[6.938,0.312,"Doing"],[7.263,0.163,"it"],[7.438,0.163,"with"],[7.612,0.637,"integrity"],[8.262,0.163,"is"],[8.438,0.225,"more"],[8.675,0.562,"important"],[9.25,0.138,"than"],[9.4,0.5,"avoiding"],[9.912,0.138,"what"],[10.062,0.1,"is"],[10.175,0.475,"hard"],[10.675,0.138,"or"],[10.825,0.3,"doing"],[11.137,0.163,"what"],[11.312,0.325,"feels"],[11.65,0.225,"good"],[11.887,0.1,"in"],[12.0,0.05,"the"],[12.062,0.475,"moment"],[12.938,0.525,"Sometimes"],[13.475,0.362,"duty"],[13.85,0.362,"asks"],[14.225,0.125,"you"],[14.363,0.1,"to"],[14.475,0.887,"sacrifice"],[15.625,0.237,"and"],[15.875,0.263,"that"],[16.15,0.175,"is"],[16.337,0.3,"part"],[16.65,0.087,"of"],[16.75,0.163,"its"],[16.925,0.562,"dignity"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"The Body Is Temporary; The Self Is Permanent","visual":["Your body, possessions and status change","Your character and values are you","External losses cannot shatter your worth"],"L":["L4"],"say":"Lesson four. The body is temporary; the Self is permanent. Like old clothes, bodies are worn and set aside. So separate who you are, your values and your character, from your circumstances. Losing something outside you does not make you less.","start":302.976,"at":303.552,"end":320.856,"words":[[0.062,0.325,"Lesson"],[0.4,0.438,"four"],[1.225,0.087,"The"],[1.325,0.388,"body"],[1.725,0.175,"is"],[1.913,0.738,"temporary"],[3.188,0.125,"the"],[3.325,0.4,"Self"],[3.737,0.163,"is"],[3.913,0.625,"permanent"],[4.925,0.163,"Like"],[5.1,0.25,"old"],[5.362,0.512,"clothes"],[5.888,0.438,"bodies"],[6.338,0.138,"are"],[6.487,0.412,"worn"],[6.912,0.125,"and"],[7.05,0.212,"set"],[7.275,0.537,"aside"],[8.175,0.163,"So"],[8.35,0.45,"separate"],[8.812,0.175,"who"],[9.0,0.188,"you"],[9.2,0.338,"are"],[9.562,0.163,"your"],[9.738,0.588,"values"],[10.338,0.113,"and"],[10.463,0.113,"your"],[10.588,0.625,"character"],[11.537,0.225,"from"],[11.775,0.113,"your"],[11.9,0.863,"circumstances"],[13.162,0.425,"Losing"],[13.6,0.425,"something"],[14.037,0.55,"outside"],[14.6,0.163,"you"],[14.775,0.175,"does"],[14.963,0.263,"not"],[15.238,0.212,"make"],[15.463,0.125,"you"],[15.6,0.463,"less"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Wisdom Means Seeing Beyond Surface Appearances","visual":["Question what you think you know","Arjuna thought killing bodies meant killing souls","Wisdom looks beneath the surface"],"L":["L5"],"say":"Lesson five. Wisdom means seeing beyond surface appearances. Arjuna was sure that ending a body meant ending a person. That one false assumption caused all his grief. Before you despair, ask whether what you are certain of is actually true.","start":320.856,"at":321.432,"end":338.856,"words":[[0.062,0.325,"Lesson"],[0.4,0.512,"five"],[1.312,0.45,"Wisdom"],[1.775,0.4,"means"],[2.188,0.438,"seeing"],[2.638,0.4,"beyond"],[3.05,0.425,"surface"],[3.487,0.713,"appearances"],[4.6,0.512,"Arjuna"],[5.125,0.138,"was"],[5.275,0.438,"sure"],[5.725,0.25,"that"],[5.987,0.3,"ending"],[6.3,0.087,"a"],[6.4,0.388,"body"],[6.8,0.325,"meant"],[7.15,0.312,"ending"],[7.475,0.075,"a"],[7.562,0.537,"person"],[8.488,0.188,"That"],[8.688,0.275,"one"],[8.975,0.375,"false"],[9.363,0.562,"assumption"],[9.938,0.388,"caused"],[10.35,0.237,"all"],[10.6,0.175,"his"],[10.787,0.537,"grief"],[11.725,0.375,"Before"],[12.113,0.125,"you"],[12.25,0.7,"despair"],[13.438,0.45,"ask"],[13.9,0.312,"whether"],[14.225,0.188,"what"],[14.425,0.125,"you"],[14.562,0.113,"are"],[14.688,0.35,"certain"],[15.05,0.2,"of"],[15.262,0.125,"is"],[15.4,0.35,"actually"],[15.762,0.425,"true"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Act Without Fear Because the Soul Cannot Perish","visual":["Understanding the soul brings courage","Danger loses its power over you","Do what is right, even when afraid"],"L":["L6"],"say":"Lesson six. Act without fear, because the soul cannot perish. Courage is not the absence of fear. It is knowing that fear does not have the last word. Once you see that death is not the end, you are free to do what is right.","start":338.856,"at":339.432,"end":355.344,"words":[[0.075,0.312,"Lesson"],[0.4,0.512,"six"],[1.312,0.263,"Act"],[1.587,0.35,"without"],[1.95,0.525,"fear"],[2.663,0.325,"because"],[3.0,0.087,"the"],[3.1,0.388,"soul"]